rules.quote:
For victims who are self-employed, the value of actual wages lost shall be
determined according to net income as reported on one or more of the
following:
a. the previous year's and/or current Federal and State Income Tax
returns;
b. the previous year's and/or current Federal 1099 forms;
c. the previous year's and/or current Schedule C;
d. W-2s, if applicable;
e. other proof of income at the time of the loss.
